<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 875)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Originals your host set as a zip of the delivery are fetched once and every clip inside is found by name; Google Drive and Dropbox links open as downloads. The invite says where the originals are.</li>
<li>Join a Review has a refresh button beside the review menu; the View menu ticks the zoom it is at.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
